{"id":"delft","name":"代尔夫特","en":"Delft","country":"Netherlands","lat":52.0117,"lng":4.3592,"dek":"运河、蓝陶与知识之城","history":"代尔夫特的名字来自一条叫奥德代尔夫的人工水道，直译是“古代排水闸”。荷兰人挖出这条水道，排干沿海沼地，市集中心渐渐在今天的市集广场一带成形。1246年，荷兰伯爵威廉二世授予它城市权利，代尔夫特由此成为荷兰较早获得城市地位的地方之一。\n\n此后数百年，城市经历过两次重创：1536年市中心一场大火烧毁大量房屋；1654年军火库爆炸又把城市一部分夷为平地。但代尔夫特也是荷兰东印度公司的据点之一，中国瓷器经此引入荷兰，最终催生了代尔夫特蓝陶。\n\n威廉亲王曾短暂居住于此，并在市中心的亲王庭院遇刺身亡。因当时王室所在地布雷达仍在西班牙控制下，新教堂被选作他的安息之地，此后王室成员遗体照例放入新教堂地窖，代尔夫特与荷兰王室的关系延续至今。","culture":"代尔夫特内城遍布水道和小桥，老建筑林立，常被人称作阿姆斯特丹的缩影。市集广场周围集中了新教堂、市政厅等建筑，步行即可在旧城格局里读出城市的历史层次。运河边的老宅、窄巷和转角的小桥，让这座小城适合慢走而非赶路，许多细节要停下来才看得见。\n\n这里也是“知识之城”。代尔夫特理工大学和荷兰应用科学研究所坐落于此，使小城在旅游之外多了一层日常的学术气息，街头常能遇到骑车的学生。蓝陶依然是当地最知名的纪念品，与中国的景德镇结为姊妹市，也算一段跨越陶瓷的因缘。老教堂的倾斜塔身、市集广场的摊位与教堂钟声，共同构成这座城安静的日常。","pull":"排水闸上长出的城市，蓝陶里映着中国。","sights":[{"name":"新教堂","orig":"Nieuwe Kerk","intro":"建于一四九六年的教堂，矗立在市集广场，是代尔夫特天际线的中心。威廉亲王一五八四年遇刺后葬于此，此后王室成员多安息在教堂地窖。塔高一百零八米余，可攀登俯瞰全城，视野好时能同时望见鹿特丹与海牙。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Nieuwe_kerk_20040311.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82_(%E4%BB%A3%E5%B0%94%E5%A4%AB%E7%89%B9)"},{"name":"老教堂","orig":"Oude Kerk","intro":"代尔夫特最古老的建筑之一，位于市中心偏东的运河边，塔身明显倾斜，成为小城一景。画家维梅尔葬于此处，教堂内部空间朴素安静。它与新教堂合用门票，适合与市集广场的行程串在一起。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Oude_Kerk_Delft_2.jpg/960px-Oude_Kerk_Delft_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%80%81%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82_(%E4%BB%A3%E7%88%BE%E5%A4%AB%E7%89%B9)"},{"name":"市政厅","orig":"Stadhuis","intro":"市集广场一端的历史建筑，一六一八年火灾后由建筑师亨德里克·德凯泽重建，保留了原有塔楼和部分墙体。建筑立面与广场的市集摊位、教堂塔楼共同构成代尔夫特最常被取景的画面。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/2011_Delft_Stadhuis_%282%29.jpg/960px-2011_Delft_Stadhuis_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":781},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delft_City_Hall"},{"name":"亲王庭院","orig":"Prinsenhof","intro":"威廉亲王曾居住的庭院，如今是博物馆。一五八四年他在此处遇刺，墙上仍保留着据说是弹孔的痕迹。馆内陈列与荷兰独立战争和代尔夫特历史相关的藏品，庭院本身安静，适合中途歇脚。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Prinsenhof_Delft.jpg/960px-Prinsenhof_Delft.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":673},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Museum_Het_Prinsenhof"},{"name":"东门","orig":"Oostpoort","intro":"代尔夫特旧城墙仅存的城门之一，位于运河东侧，带两座尖顶小塔。它建于中世纪，是内城水道与城门格局的实物见证。清晨或傍晚经过时，砖墙倒映在水面上，是旧城边缘最安静的一角。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Overzicht_zuiveringshuis%2C_behorende_bij_de_Oostergasfabriek%2C_gezien_vanaf_het_water_-_Amsterdam_-_20409056_-_RCE.jpg/960px-Overzicht_zuiveringshuis%2C_behorende_bij_de_Oostergasfabriek%2C_gezien_vanaf_het_water_-_Amsterdam_-_20409056_-_RCE.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oostpoort"}],"foods":[{"name":"荷兰松饼","orig":"Stroopwafel","intro":"两片薄烤面饼夹入焦糖糖浆，趁热吃时糖浆微融。代尔夫特市中心周四和周六的市集上常现做现卖，路过能闻到焦糖香。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Gaufre_biscuit.jpg/960px-Gaufre_biscuit.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":643},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E5%BC%8F%E9%AC%86%E9%A4%85"},{"name":"苹果派","orig":"Appeltaart","intro":"荷兰常见的家常甜点，厚实饼底上堆满苹果块，常配一勺打发奶油。代尔夫特不少午餐咖啡馆自制苹果派，适合下午配咖啡。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Apple_pie_14.jpg/960px-Apple_pie_14.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apple_pie"},{"name":"生鲱鱼","orig":"Haring","intro":"荷兰传统吃法，鲱鱼经腌制后配洋葱和酸黄瓜，可整条入口或夹在面包里。代尔夫特市集的鱼摊上常见，是本地人的日常小食。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Global_capture_of_all_herring_1950%E2%80%932010.png/960px-Global_capture_of_all_herring_1950%E2%80%932010.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":518},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AF%A1%E9%AD%9A"},{"name":"炸鱼块","orig":"Kibbeling","intro":"把鳕鱼类鱼肉切块裹糊油炸，通常配蒜酱或蛋黄酱，趁热吃外脆里嫩。代尔夫特市集的鱼摊有售，适合边走边吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/2021-10-13-Kibbeling-4943.jpg/960px-2021-10-13-Kibbeling-4943.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kibbeling"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/Delft_Blick_von_der_Nieuwe_Kerk_auf_die_Oude_Kerk_1.jpg/1280px-Delft_Blick_von_der_Nieuwe_Kerk_auf_die_Oude_Kerk_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":879},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Vermeer-view-of-delft.jpg/1280px-Vermeer-view-of-delft.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":1063}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[4.3202178,52.0080654],[4.3232445,52.0043356],[4.3263463,52.0052928],[4.3257598,52.0060171],[4.3282674,52.0059134],[4.3326558,52.0078828],[4.3363709,52.0047532],[4.3384533,52.0056907],[4.3411426,52.0027104],[4.3358344,52.0010553],[4.337717,51.9988025],[4.3315251,51.9978522],[4.3331096,51.9931718],[4.3257324,51.9919512],[4.324112,51.9898586],[4.3284877,51.985702],[4.3319565,51.9844324],[4.3326129,51.980698],[4.3382215,51.9742281],[4.3431478,51.975674],[4.3566259,51.9772963],[4.3573924,51.9754643],[4.3585717,51.9756579],[4.3588317,51.9750201],[4.3576475,51.9748241],[4.3582001,51.9735033],[4.3593682,51.97355],[4.3585561,51.9726751],[4.3599457,51.9724544],[4.358721,51.9722609],[4.3595403,51.9701354],[4.3681739,51.9715818],[4.3691755,51.9688705],[4.3863029,51.972214],[4.3836225,51.9758159],[4.3938099,51.9775035],[4.3941682,51.9763205],[4.396174,51.9760802],[4.3967458,51.9741808],[4.3977231,51.9743336],[4.3991215,51.9709746],[4.4029335,51.9663163],[4.4079109,51.9681986],[4.4033896,51.9731328],[4.4011524,51.978346],[4.3970302,51.978974],[4.3859158,52.0048353],[4.3886557,52.0054935],[4.3883456,52.0094476],[4.394516,52.0112556],[4.386245,52.0233082],[4.3798088,52.0266635],[4.3734992,52.0325988],[4.3597695,52.026546],[4.3588487,52.0273339],[4.3259562,52.0127933],[4.3254708,52.0108692],[4.3206358,52.009322],[4.3214901,52.0084635],[4.3202178,52.0080654]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"代尔夫特","en":"Delft","voyage":"Delft"}}}